description: No git Co-authored-by / AI co-authorship on commits
alwaysApply: true
---

# No co-authorship

Never add co-authors to git commits in this repo.

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by:` trailers (Cursor, Copilot, ChatGPT, or any other agent/tool).
- Do **not** set commit author/committer to an AI identity.
- Commits are authored solely by the human operator’s configured git identity.
- When creating commits, use only the message body requested by the user — no co-author footers, no “Generated by …” attribution lines in the commit message.

If the environment still injects `Co-authored-by:` after `git commit`, rewrite HEAD with `git commit-tree` (same tree/parent, clean message) so the trailer is not in history.
